  {
   "index": 8,
   "tag": "p×3",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "section"
   ],
   "textLength": 690,
   "text": "Flex allows your dataset to span both high-performance RAM and cost-efficient dedicated Flash memory. Flex automatically manages data placement between the two tiers, keeping frequently accessed (“hot”) data in RAM for sub-millisecond latency, while moving less active (“warm”) data to Flash to optimize capacity and cost. This dual memory architecture delivers predictable performance at scale, enab",
   "counts": {
